# CHANGELOG

LEGEND:
Development version <VERSION x.x.x> - <DATE> yyyy-mm-dd - Specifies latest version, not current changes in this codebase. use UNRELEASED for the date if that is the case

Development version Alpha 0.0.1 - 2026-08-03
-----------------------------------------------
- Initialized repository and configuration
- Made editor menu and project creator tool that outputs a menu/form file
- Boundary between framework/engine and the editor established
- Added export functionality
- Editor knows if it's being developed or if it's built and being used in a workspace and knows where to put and update UI files
- UI hot reloading
- Application hot reloading

Development version Alpha 0.0.2 - 2026-08-07
-----------------------------------------------
- Editors can be hot-reloaded
- Editor Utility now loads the current project into memory on creation
- Created basic layout for editors with a canvas, widgets, options, and properties viewports
- Added all widgets, and editor support for headers, labels, and buttons. Button support is full
- Updated framework assumptions and migrated them back to the framework repo
- Removed Pause states. Generalized app navigation in editor's options section
- Can save using CTRL+S
- Editor can now edit its own main menu file

Development version Alpha 0.0.3 - 2026-08-09
-----------------------------------------------
- Added full project browser that automatically loads whatever you select into the editor
- Forms can be edited now
- Editor can now fully edit its own UI visually
- Added ScrollableText, Query, and Input widgets
- Main menu now displays changelog
- Editor is fully functional according to its design

Development version Alpha 0.1.0 - 2026-09-01
---------------------------------------------
- Added world Editor
- Added map selector
- Added cell palette
- Can edit worlds of any size and add as many maps to any world as you please 
- Can render the whole world at once or a single position at a time
- Bug fixes to UIEditor
- Builds now reset dev to true after building